    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Trivial LU decomposition and back substitution <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_solver" kindref="compound">Solver</ref></para>
<para>This solver was implemented during the 2010 CSMP retreat by MUL in Starigrad, Croatia, and used to solve FEM matrices with up to 300 dof. As in Numerical Recipes C++, Cambridge 3rd Edition. Adapted to comply with <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_sparse_matrix" kindref="compound">csmp::SparseMatrix</ref>, STL and according functionality</para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>This is a direct solver and therefore works only for small systems.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>P. Lang </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2010 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
